    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948120/extras/d5c2f6818402df5fb7d347625d577fdb.avif?t=1755148661\" width=800 height=374 /></span><strong>Dive into the heart of terror with Shadows Of Despair, a spine-chilling co-op horror experience for up to four players. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate through eerie, intricately designed maps, each hosting multiple Case Files that blend intense main challenges with three additional objectives.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter a variety of foes with unique personalities and humorous voice lines, making every session a blend of fear and dark comedy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together to solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and survive the night in an immersive horror adventure where teamwork is your only hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op horror game for up to four players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricately designed Case Files with major and minor challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies with unique personalities and humorous voice lines </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborative puzzle-solving and secret uncovering </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival-focused gameplay requiring teamwork </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonic AI adds dark comedy to the terror </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression system unlocking new content and maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed, immersive environments enhance the horror </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous updates promise future content and improvements</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948120/extras/d5c2f6818402df5fb7d347625d577fdb.avif?t=1755148661\" width=800 height=374 /></span><strong>Dive into the heart of terror with Shadows Of Despair, a spine-chilling co-op horror experience for up to four players. </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate through eerie, intricately designed maps, each hosting multiple Case Files that blend intense main challenges with three additional objectives.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter a variety of foes with unique personalities and humorous voice lines, making every session a blend of fear and dark comedy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together to solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and survive the night in an immersive horror adventure where teamwork is your only hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op horror game for up to four players </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intricately designed Case Files with major and minor challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies with unique personalities and humorous voice lines </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborative puzzle-solving and secret uncovering </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival-focused gameplay requiring teamwork </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demonic AI adds dark comedy to the terror </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression system unlocking new content and maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed, immersive environments enhance the horror </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuous updates promise future content and improvements</p></li></ul>",
